[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705433950","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103602#issuecomment-2705433950","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103602","id":2705433950,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hQaVe","user":{"login":"Clancey","id":256046,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NjA0Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/256046?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey","html_url":"https://github.com/Clancey","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Clancey/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-03-07T03:25:24Z","updated_at":"2025-03-07T03:25:43Z","body":"I found the issue. If a panoramo skybox has the wrong import type:\n```\nimporter=\"cubemap_texture\"\ntype=\"CompressedCubemap\"\n```\n\n\nIt crashes Godot. This was not an issue in previous versions. Maybe the cubemap importer should validate the dimensions to ensure it's square to prevent the crash. Or the metal renderer can validate rather than crashing.\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2705433950/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731063793","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103602#issuecomment-2731063793","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103602","id":2731063793,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iyLnx","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T22:19:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T22:19:44Z","body":"What are the exact steps to validate this?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731063793/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731230046","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103602#issuecomment-2731230046","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103602","id":2731230046,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iy0Ne","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T00:03:22Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T00:05:49Z","body":"This issue doesn't appear to be exclusive to Metal or macOS. On Linux + Vulkan, I can reproduce rendering issues, although it doesn't crash or print an error. It seems the Cubemap importer can't deal with non-square cubemaps correctly, even though the size reported in the inspector for each face is correct:\n \nSquare cubemap | Non-square cubemap (4:1 aspect ratio)\n-|-\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b534f7ab-eb04-4da7-94fa-74ddf4f87ed4) | ![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/198fccb2-9b74-4938-89db-d1c0d8eafcaa)\n\nI've also tried to create the Cubemap from code to no avail:\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2aecaf7b-d1be-4fe1-ab4c-c43cf3c4425f)\n\n(It renders perfectly when its faces have a 1:1 aspect ratio.)\n\nHowever, given the Metal limitation of requiring square cubemaps, I suppose we should do two things to ensure consistent behavior across platforms:\n\n- Forbid creating Cubemap/CubemapArray resources from code with non-square images (print an error).\n- Make the Cubemap importer resize images to have a square aspect ratio by upscaling their lower-resolution axis, so that they are imported correctly.\n\n**Minimal reproduction project:** [test_cubemap_non_square.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19302507/test_cubemap_non_square.zip)\nThe MRP includes a script that creates a Cubemap from code when you run the project.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2731230046/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735046141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103602#issuecomment-2735046141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103602","id":2735046141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jBX39","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T01:00:28Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T01:00:28Z","body":"I can recreate on macOS\n\n- Metal always asserts\n- Vulkan (MoltenVK) is worse and crashes the GPU\n\n@Calinou see #104341 which should address these issues. There was a bug in the Metal driver such that it couldn't create views for cube textures and incorrectly calculated the layout for cube textures.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2735046141/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]